      "text": "7. B: Dàole Yīduàn yǐhòu, qǐng zài   After you have gotten to Section 1,\n      wèn biéren ba.                  please ask someone else.\n   A: Hǎo. Xièxie.                    All right. Thanks.\n\nNote on No. 7\n\nZài, \"and then\": In exchange 7, the adverb zài is used for the second action in a sequence. It is not easily translated into English.\n"
